# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# The Temple Puja — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the values for your deployment.
# Everything degrades gracefully: site works without any of these set.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── MongoDB Atlas ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# When set, devotee profiles, catalog overrides, admin sessions, and
# credentials are stored in MongoDB for cross-device persistence.
# Without these the server falls back to local JSON files, then memory.
# MONGODB_URI=mongodb+srv://<user>:<password>@<cluster>.mongodb.net/templepuja
# MONGODB_DB=templepuja

# ── Razorpay (live payments) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Get keys from https://dashboard.razorpay.com/app/keys
# Without these, checkout uses a simulated payment flow (demo mode).
# RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=rzp_test_XXXXXXXXXXXX
# RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
# RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=your_webhook_secret_here

# ── Twilio WhatsApp (booking notifications) ───────────────────────────
# When configured, admin and devotee receive WhatsApp alerts on every
# booking event. Without these, the site works but no messages are sent.
# TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=ACXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
# TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=your_auth_token_here
# TWILIO_WHATSAPP_FROM=whatsapp:+14155238886
# ADMIN_WHATSAPP_TO=whatsapp:+918765301563

# ── Cron Job Security ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Required for /api/cron/booking-reminders. Generate a strong secret:
#   node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('hex'))"
# Without this, the cron endpoint returns 503 (refuses to run).
# CRON_SECRET=your_random_secret_here

# ── Public Site URL ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Used in sitemap.xml, canonical URLs, and the receipt link in WhatsApp
# messages. Falls back to the request Host header in dev.
# SITE_URL=https://thetemplepuja.com

# ── Dev / Testing Only ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Force the in-memory store (ignores MongoDB and JSON files).
# Never set this in production.
# TTP_STORE=memory

# Custom directory for the JSON file store (default: .data/).
# TTP_DATA_DIR=/path/to/data
